## Sacred and third-party content is excluded

| Content | Owner / Source | Terms |
|---|---|---|
| **The Holy Quran (Uthmani text)** | Revealed text; distributed via AlQuran Cloud API | Must never be altered, truncated, or misrepresented |
| **Audio recitations** | Each individual reciter | Streamed from the Islamic Network CDN under their terms |
| **`Amiri` and `Amiri Quran` fonts** | Their respective type designers | SIL Open Font License (OFL) |
| **Quran text API** | AlQuran Cloud | Subject to their terms of service |
| **Audio CDN** | Islamic Network | Subject to their terms of service |

If you fork or redistribute this project, **you are responsible** for
complying with the terms of each of these sources.

## A condition of use: do not alter the sacred text

Because this project presents the words of Allah ﷻ, the following conditions
apply to any use or redistribution of this software, in addition to the MIT
terms above:

1. **The Quranic text must not be modified, added to, removed from, or
   reordered.** The Uthmani script is transmitted exactly as received.
2. **The sacred text must not be used to mislead.** Do not present altered or
   fabricated text as Quran.
3. **Attribution must not be removed** from Quranic content or recitations.
4. **The app must not be used to cause harm, spread falsehood, or for any
   purpose contrary to Islamic ethics.** This is an act of worship, and should
   be treated as one.

These conditions reflect the purpose of the project — an ongoing charity
intended for the sake of Allah ﷻ. They are stated plainly so that anyone
reusing this work understands what is being handled.

## Attribution

If you build on this project, please keep the attribution in place, and — if
you are able — make du'a for those who contributed to it. That is the only
compensation the authors seek.

